                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Despite how much I want to like this game, I can't really recommend it to anyone. It feels half-finished, or maybe half-started. The enemies lack death animations, and just fade after you deal lethal damage, still standing. I had a single somewhat challenging battle in the 90 minutes I've played so far, and like 30 really boring, rote ones. There's progression somewhere, but the core gameplay loop is just not there to want me to come back.",
